e its way through  various pockets of social media fans  began to post some of Walter's most  memorable moments  vulture's Wolfgang roof fondly  remembered how Walters called the  Kardashian family untalented in a  damning interview while a Twitter user  shared a playful video of the  broadcaster giving pop sensation Beyonce  five dollars to sing for her perhaps the  most fitting tribute to cement Walter's  Legacy is one that took place nearly a  decade ago during her final appearance  as a co-host on The View in 2014 her  colleagues in Winfrey brought out over a  dozen female journalists to thank  Walters for her trailblazing efforts the  tribute to the journalist went viral  following her death  [Music]
 

